        "abstract": "T-2 was founded in 2004 as the first alternative operator with the ambition to start the active development of the Slovenian telecommunications market and bring it closer to the developing technologies, which at the time heralded extraordinary changes in the development of the telecommunications market. From 2005 to 2007, we were among the first in Europe to offer services to our clients based on VDSL1, which we later upgraded to VDSL2. At the same time, we started building and offering services based on the Fibre to the Home Point-to-Point technical solution, which in 2018 we replaced with the GPON Point-to-Multipoint solution. We are firmly embedded in the environment in which we operate, we listen to each individual and take the sustainability aspect of business and wider operations into account. Being a company of satisfied employees, we respond to the challenges of profitable growth and are jointly building T-2 into a leading provider on the market. We have more than 430 employees",
